      "content": "thanks for the advice. i'm a bit nervous tho because i have a slight fluttering feeling in my chest sometimes too, but it's not really painful. i'm 72 so i don't want to make a big deal out of nothing and end up in the ER for no reason if it's just because i need more electrolytes. u think it's really worth calling a doctor if i feel fine now?",
